<h2>The five levels at a glance</h2>
<p>Second Brains divide into five levels by <strong>"how well you find and recall"</strong>. Each level answers a <strong>different question</strong>. The ladder below means <strong>smarter search as you go up</strong>, but it also means <strong>more complexity and higher cost</strong>.</p>

